WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.041
WOOHOO!!!!

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:02.625
Hey, Aaron, is it just me, or

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:04.291
is this year’s Quarter-Season Carnival…

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:05.333
kinda soft?

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.333
Sir, you’re going to have to leave

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:06.833
Noooo

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:07.833
I love quarterbacks

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:08.625
I’m sorry

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:12.000
Hey look, guys

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.041
I finally hit the target!

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:14.125
I’m sorry

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:15.750
I know everyone’s rooting for me

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.416
Don’t worry

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.708
The Colts will help you win!

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:19.166
OH, I’M PATTY MAHOMES

00:00:19.166 --> 00:00:20.750
AND I SHOOT REAL GOOD

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.750
Come ride Booger McFarland’s Sideline Machine!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.083
WELL, THE CONDITIONS HERE

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:26.541
AT THE CARNIVAL ARE VERY SCARY

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.291
Sir, you’re up

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:29.291
Nope. Not yet.

00:00:29.291 --> 00:00:30.625
Man, where’s Eli?

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.083
He said he’d connect with us here

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.583
HELP! I’M NOT A MOBILE QB!

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:34.916
I’M OLD AND SCARED

00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:35.625
God damn-

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:38.458
Odell, you’re polite now, remember?

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:39.875
I love dealing with Eli

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:40.958
I can’t move my feet!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.958
ELI! WHERE ARE YOU?!

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.083
I won’t leave my corn pocket

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:45.916
A PASS-RUSHER

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.333
LOOKING FOR A PASS-RUSHER!

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.208
ANY QUARTERBACKS!

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:49.250
I’M LOOKING FOR ANY

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.125
NON-CONTROVERSIAL QUARTERBACKS!

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.333
ANYBODY ON THE STEELERS!

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.083
WHERE YOU AT!

00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:53.958
Shhhhhhh

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:55.041
Don’t tell

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.375
No siree, Bob

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:58.458
that maze is too tricky for me!

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.000
WOW, WHAT A FUN, EASY MAZE

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:04.833
Subscribe to this channel

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:06.875
Watch more episodes

00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:08.125
I gotta go

